&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabled flash attention on older NVIDIA GPUs (compute capability 6.x)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;iGPU can now offload vision models with padding to fit available memory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed structured output for thinking models when thinking is disabled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardened GGUF model creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ollama launch&lt;/code&gt; for Claude Code now disables telemetry by default&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed loading models on paths with non-UTF-8 characters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated the MLX and llama.cpp engines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;New Contributors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/kevinpark1217/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kevinpark1217&quot;&gt;@kevinpark1217&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4761683278&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/issues/16949&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ollama/ollama/pull/16949/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/16949&quot;&gt;#16949&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.31.1...v0.31.2&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v0.31.1...v0.31.2&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;llm: allow iGPU mmproj offload with fit padding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;llama.cpp&#39;s fit pass sizes text-model placement before the multimodal projector is loaded. Ollama had been avoiding that risk on non-Metal iGPUs by disabling projector offload entirely, which forces CLIP onto CPU on GB10 and Strix Halo even when the projector has ample memory available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let integrated GPUs use the same projector-memory check as other GPUs. When projector offload is enabled, add the estimated projector memory plus the existing 1 GiB headroom to Ollama-owned LLAMA_ARG_FIT_TARGET so fit leaves space for the later projector allocation. If Ollama/device setup already supplied a fit target, add the projector pad to it. If the user set LLAMA_ARG_FIT_TARGET explicitly, leave it exactly as provided.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixes &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4569968989&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/issues/16419&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/ollama/ollama/issues/16419/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/issues/16419&quot;&gt;#16419&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;review comments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;vLLM v0.24.0 Release Notes&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release features 571 commits from 256 contributors (77 new)!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MiniMax-M3&lt;/strong&gt;: Added support for the new &lt;strong&gt;MiniMax-M3&lt;/strong&gt; model (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4647355834&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45381&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45381/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45381&quot;&gt;#45381&lt;/a&gt;), with a fast follow-on of BF16/FP8 indexer via MSA (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4680019767&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45892&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45892/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45892&quot;&gt;#45892&lt;/a&gt;), MXFP4 support (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4680317418&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45896&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45896/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45896&quot;&gt;#45896&lt;/a&gt;), FP8 sparse GQA (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4669482520&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45744&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45744/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45744&quot;&gt;#45744&lt;/a&gt;), and extensive AMD/ROCm tuning — mxfp8 MoE/linear on gfx950 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4667972020&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45725&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45725/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45725&quot;&gt;#45725&lt;/a&gt;), fp8_per_channel for bf16 weights on MI300X (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4676876725&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45854&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45854/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45854&quot;&gt;#45854&lt;/a&gt;), FP8 KV-cache fix (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4667558262&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45720&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45720/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45720&quot;&gt;#45720&lt;/a&gt;), and packed-modules mapping (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4672495725&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45794&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45794/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45794&quot;&gt;#45794&lt;/a&gt;). A MiniMax-M2 perf regression was also fixed (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4684156151&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45935&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45935/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45935&quot;&gt;#45935&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DeepSeek-V4 keeps maturing&lt;/strong&gt;: Following its debut, DeepSeek-V4 received another large optimization pass — a FlashInfer sparse index cache (2–4% TTFT) (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4677606814&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45863&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45863/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45863&quot;&gt;#45863&lt;/a&gt;), prefill chunk-planning optimization (4% E2E throughput) (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4625430809&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45061&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45061/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45061&quot;&gt;#45061&lt;/a&gt;), a cluster-cooperative topK kernel for low-latency (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4471755098&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/43008&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/43008/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/43008&quot;&gt;#43008&lt;/a&gt;), contiguous per-block KV allocations (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4591995621&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/44577&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44577/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44577&quot;&gt;#44577&lt;/a&gt;), TEP=16 for the block-FP8 shared expert (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4689688057&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46001&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46001/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46001&quot;&gt;#46001&lt;/a&gt;), and native DSA indexer decode for &lt;code&gt;next_n &amp;gt; 2&lt;/code&gt; on SM100 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4644349545&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45322&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45322/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45322&quot;&gt;#45322&lt;/a&gt;). It is now enabled on &lt;strong&gt;SM120&lt;/strong&gt; alongside GLM-5.1 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4507838459&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/43477&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/43477/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/43477&quot;&gt;#43477&lt;/a&gt;), with XPU (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4559603582&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/44144&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44144/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44144&quot;&gt;#44144&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4587140845&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/44517&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44517/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44517&quot;&gt;#44517&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4637742183&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45240&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45240/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45240&quot;&gt;#45240&lt;/a&gt;) and ROCm (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4614520678&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/44899&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44899/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44899&quot;&gt;#44899&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4627834513&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45103&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45103/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45103&quot;&gt;#45103&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4663960710&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45681&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45681/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45681&quot;&gt;#45681&lt;/a&gt;) attention/MoE paths added.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Runner V2 (MRv2) continues to expand&lt;/strong&gt;: MRv2 now &lt;strong&gt;supports quantized models by default&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4583187242&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/44446&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44446/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44446&quot;&gt;#44446&lt;/a&gt;), enables &lt;strong&gt;GraniteMoE by default&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4652893929&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45461&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45461/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45461&quot;&gt;#45461&lt;/a&gt;), and gained migration of Qwen + DeepSeek-V2 MoE models (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4448380363&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/42667&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/42667/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/42667&quot;&gt;#42667&lt;/a&gt;), DFlash speculative decoding (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4592519415&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/44586&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44586/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/44586&quot;&gt;#44586&lt;/a&gt;), and more accurate FP32 Gumbel sampling (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4689272752&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45996&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45996/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45996&quot;&gt;#45996&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Streaming Parser Engine&lt;/strong&gt;: A new streaming parser engine unifies tool-call/reasoning parsing across models, with parsers for Qwen3 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4649937169&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45413&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45413/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45413&quot;&gt;#45413&lt;/a&gt;), MiniMax-M2 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4665415121&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45701&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45701/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45701&quot;&gt;#45701&lt;/a&gt;), GLM-4.7/5.1/5.2 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4681600062&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45915&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45915/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45915&quot;&gt;#45915&lt;/a&gt;), and Nemotron V3 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4670206059&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45755&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45755/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45755&q